{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375890/extras/35cb3459c9e241c26bbeb0917ced0830.poster.avif?t=1756986730\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375890/extras/35cb3459c9e241c26bbeb0917ced0830.webm?t=1756986730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375890/extras/35cb3459c9e241c26bbeb0917ced0830.mp4?t=1756986730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375890/extras/f800acfef89fdd72564f84244e4d6546.avif?t=1756986730\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Traverse through transforming space chambers in this <strong>ROGUELIKE BULLET HELL\u00a0 !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>CHOOSE CAREFULLY</strong> which locations suits your needs the best, while making sure you don't anger the ogres beyond your guns' cabalities !!! \ud83d\udc80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375890/extras/e15f3b6a984fad3c55c94afbfab6de8e.avif?t=1756986730\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIND UPGRADES</strong> and abilities  from the chambers. <strong>COMBINE ABILITIES\u00a0</strong>to transform your spaceship into an unstoppable killing machine!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PR